# `docker compose build` doesn't ship gigabytes of local artefacts.
.git
**/node_modules
**/.next
**/target
**/.venv
**/__pycache__
**/.mypy_cache
**/.ruff_cache
**/.pytest_cache
**/test-results
**/playwright-report
perf-results
docs
evals
